# ---- 注入体产物（由 make-inject*.mjs 从 `.user.js` 生成，可随时重建）----
# 不入库理由：它们是交付物的派生物，且曾因「同版本号的旧快照」导致过注入不生效。
# 重建：node .playwright-mcp/make-inject.mjs
.playwright-mcp/inject-body.js
.playwright-mcp/inject-test.js
.playwright-mcp/inject-body-*.js
.playwright-mcp/inject-test-*.js

# ---- 临时/调试产物 ----
.playwright-mcp/_*/
.playwright-mcp/*.log
.playwright-mcp/*.png
.playwright-mcp/*.har

# ---- 操作系统 ----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- 编辑器 ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
